{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00854","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 上之回 · 李白","name":"鼓吹曲辞 上之回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十六离宫，楼台与天通。\n阁道步行月，美人愁烟空。\n恩疎宠不及，桃李伤春风。\n淫乐意何极，金舆向回中。\n万乘出黄道，千旗扬彩虹。\n前军细柳北，後骑甘泉东。\n岂问渭川老，宁邀襄野童。\n秋暮瑶池宴，归来乐未穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}